                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Bad Rats: the Rats' Revenge is truly one of the greatest gems I've ever had the absolute pleasure to play. Truly amazing and truly important for the history of videogames. Absolute and a truly mastery on the enviroment, perfect mise en scène and a truly amazing message for the younger generations. In Bad Rats: the Rats' Revenge all the players have truly discovered why videogames were truly created. Truly a mastery of the mouse (rats) idiosyncracy.\n\nIn the other hand, Bad Rats is a truly physics puzzle game where rats finally and truly get their bloody revenge on their new prisoners: The cats.\n\nThanks Bad Rats: the Rats' Revenge for (help i want to k-i-l-l m-y-$-e-l-f) truly saved my life.",
